@Gateway_HostAddress = http://localhost:5100
@Keycloak_HostAddress = http://localhost:8180

### Start the AppHost first. Every call needs a token, so run the login first. The requests go through the gateway.
### The order number is the idempotency key. Asking again for the same order changes nothing.
### The seed data holds 50 copies of every book of the Catalog service.

### Login of alice (password: alice) => OK, with the access token for the requests below
# @name alice
POST {{Keycloak_HostAddress}}/realms/cat-demo/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=cat-demo-cli&username=alice&password=alice

### StockReserveRequest => OK (2 copies of 1984 and 1 of Clean Code)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/inventory/reservations HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "20261106-9101",
  "lines": [
    { "isbn": "9780141036144", "quantity": 2 },
    { "isbn": "9780132350884", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### StockReserveRequest => OK, nothing changes because the order has its stock already
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/inventory/reservations HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "20261106-9101",
  "lines": [
    { "isbn": "9780141036144", "quantity": 2 },
    { "isbn": "9780132350884", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### StockReserveRequest => Conflict, out of stock (CAT-INV-1000). The first line is not reserved either.
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/inventory/reservations HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "20261106-9102",
  "lines": [
    { "isbn": "9780132350884", "quantity": 1 },
    { "isbn": "9780141036144", "quantity": 51 }
  ]
}

### StockReserveRequest => Not Found, the book is not in the warehouse (CAT-INV-1001)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/inventory/reservations HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "20261106-9103",
  "lines": [ { "isbn": "9789999999999", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### StockReserveRequest => Bad request, no lines
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/inventory/reservations HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "20261106-9104",
  "lines": []
}

### StockReserveRequest => Unauthorized, no token
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/inventory/reservations HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderNumber": "20261106-9105",
  "lines": [ { "isbn": "9780141036144", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### StockReleaseRequest => OK, the stock of the first order is back
DELETE {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/inventory/reservations/20261106-9101 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.response.body.$.access_token}}
